# English in this repository

This public repo is English-first. It **overrides** any workspace habit of Portuguese commits.

Chat with the user may stay in Portuguese. **Anything that lands in git is English.**

## Commits, PRs, issues

Conventional English subject (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`). Body, PR title/description, and new CHANGELOG lines in English.

```
# BAD
docs: recuo e divisórias na sidebar

# GOOD
docs: indent nested pages under sidebar section titles
```

## Docs and copy

Canonical: `README.md`, `docs/**/*.md` (not `*.pt.md`), comments, logs, errors, GitHub templates.

Portuguese **only** as a translation of an English original: `*.pt.md`, `*.pt-BR.md`, `web/src/locales/pt-BR.json`. Add `en.json` first, then translate.

Never add Portuguese-only docs or UI strings.

## API and identifiers

Paths, query params, JSON keys, env vars, `rule_id`, and metric names stay English.

New hub/agent/user-facing strings: English. Do not add Portuguese-only API copy.
